      "t": "interlude",
      "text": "Modern Drunkard",
      "sub": "loose pages · verse",
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "He relaxes against the hill\nWhere grass meets concrete shore\nAnd raises the oblong can\nTo his lips."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Later he pisses into it\nThis half-mile long fountain\nThe moon like a smile"
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Reflected disrupted wavering.\nCross-legged he sits\nMore listening to\nThan watching the ducks\nTiny bobbing shapes catching light."
    },
